      "funding_type": "loan",
      "typical_award_size": "Total HOME-ARP allocation $4,960,751 (available through September 30, 2030). Amended plan: rental housing development $2,500,000 (reserved to Sendero Commons, Sanger, 87 PSH units at 30% AMI), supportive services $1,717,851, administration $742,900; the original 100% developer match requirement and the $450,000 operating reserve were removed. Housing production goal reduced to 10 qualifying-population units.",
